> f(x: u8) = isqrt(x-1)
> domain f
domain of f:
  x: u8, 0..255
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 256 of 256 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..15   (16 distinct values)
  values: 0..15
  fits in u4
  over all 256 points of the domain
> wrap f
wrap analysis of f:
  x - 1   (u8)
      nuw fails: unsigned wrap at 1 points, e.g. x=0
      nsw fails: signed wrap at 1 points, e.g. x=128
  end to end: differs from the mathematical result at 0 points, e.g. 
      exact for: 1..255
  over all 256 points of the domain
> equiv f f
f and f are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
